    },
    {
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "telop" : "「いえいえ。」僕はそう言い、彼女を見る。\nすると、ハッと過去を思い出す。",
      "id" : "53E77624-23CC-4DBA-B685-6AD62D224EBC",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "title" : "シーン 48",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "voiceDuration" : 5.266938775510204,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #48",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 5.866938775510204,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_048_操夢.wav",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e.048.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "telop" : "それは、今から10年ほど前の、ある劇の発表日だった。その日は、参観日だったが、周りの同級生と違い、両親は来なかった。",
      "id" : "EE5044A2-B5B7-48F8-AD74-8732AEC01BBB",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "title" : "シーン 49",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "voiceDuration" : 9.588684807256236,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #49",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 10.188684807256235,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_049_操夢.wav",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e.049.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "telop" : "僕は、その発表をつまらなく感じ、ぼっと席を立ち、当時の先生、初恋であった彼女…フランを一瞬見て、教室を飛び出す。",
      "id" : "899CC756-D71B-4604-A6C6-E49546760885",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "title" : "シーン 50",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "voiceDuration" : 9.077823129251701,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #50",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（微笑）.png",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 9.677823129251701,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_050_操夢.wav",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e.050.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "telop" : "そして、彼女にある告白をする。その当時は、単に「ありがとう。」と返される程度だった。",
      "id" : "BBF994DF-7437-454C-96B7-DAF0B665E9D0",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "title" : "シーン 51",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.665850340136055,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #51",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（微笑）.png",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 9.265850340136055,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_051_操夢.wav",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e\/元女子校の日常　第9話_dace56b32e.051.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "telop" : "「あれから、10年ちょっとなんですね…」\n僕はそうぼさっと呟く。",
      "id" : "6C2778A7-3331-4024-A1BF-96DAE13F5FB8",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "title" : "シーン 52",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "voiceDuration" : 4.238684807256236,
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #52",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "duration" : 4.838684807256236,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_052_操夢.wav",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
